WEBVTT

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:55.340
Lord Hades.

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:00.840
It's you, Pandora.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:07.980
I sincerely apologize for disturbing you
in the midst of your enjoyment.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.140
It's all right.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.730
What did you want?

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.020
Uh... Well...

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:17.050
We have just been informed that
Mandrake Fyodor, of the Wounded Star,

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:20.170
was killed by something or someone on the
Yomitsu Hirasaka Path to the Underworld,

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:23.120
which falls within our jurisdiction.

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:27.990
Before his death, Fyodor was able to send word

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:30.250
that someone someone who is connected to you

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:35.000
who looked like Pegasus was captured.

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.510
I see.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:43.650
Of course, I know Your Majesty finished off
the Pegasus Saint with your own hand.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:46.140
It must be some kind of mistake.

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:48.520
The Pegasus Saint fell to the Underworld where,

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:53.260
as per the law of the land, he perished.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:55.520
Moreover...

00:02:55.520 --> 00:03:00.380
Pegasus has disappeared from the constellations

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:03.280
that indicate the Saints' lives.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.710
Where are you going?

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:13.880
What are you talking about?

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.210
A mission that could change this Holy War's course?

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:19.460
Of the three major leaders within
the Specter Army,

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:22.970
one of them is heading toward the Sanctuary!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:28.150
I must hurry and return to life,
to protect Sasha and...

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.170
You mean Lady Athena!

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:32.250
Don't call her that!

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.190
That hurts, Yato!

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:37.820
You came to bring me back to life, right?!

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:40.320
Don't you forget this!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.950
I didn't come to the Underworld for fun!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.200
This just happened, all right?
It just happened!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:47.580
What do you mean, it just happened?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.800
I mean, well...

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:53.780
You were killed by Hades,
and went down so easily...

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.210
It wasn't easily!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.730
But you did!

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.390
So then,

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:03.610
Yuzuriha suddenly appeared,
and we had to go to Jamir.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.720
Jamir?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.730
So our friendship is a problem.

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:10.680
We're wasting our time by resting.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.230
Who's resting?

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.810
Tell me all about it later.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:22.110
Right now, our priority is to find a
path to the deepest part of the Underworld

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:22.980
Let's go.

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:24.280
Wait!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.110
Yuzuriha!

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:34.590
<i>That bracelet carries
Lady Athena's prayers...</i>

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:38.350
<i>But when all the petals wither,
you'll really be dead.</i>

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:44.280
<i>I'm not dying here.
I'm getting home, no matter what!</i>

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.500
<i>Wait for us, Sasha!</i>

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:50.160
<i>I see, Sasha...</i>

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.430
<i>No, Athena.</i>

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.190
By the way, Pandora.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:01.240
Are the Specters who were
on their way to the Sanctuary safe?

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.320
You need not worry.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:09.570
Griffin Minos is one of the three
strongest soldiers of Hades.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:17.080
Before the puppet master, Minos,
the Sanctuary is nothing but his theater.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.540
It appears to have begun.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:37.600
Damn it. I won't let you take a single step
into the Sanctuary, Specters.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:41.110
I respect your devotion to your job.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.500
But you're weak.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.930
If you don't have the power to go against me,

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:51.120
you're nothing more than my puppet.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:55.670
Whether it's we, your enemies,
or the Lady Athena, herself!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.120
<i>Cosmic Marionettion!</i>

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:06.630
It's as if my body were pulled by strings.
My body just moves...

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.940
A life whose fate lies at my fingertips

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:13.580
is truly fragile.

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:27.490
Sir Minos.

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:32.620
We have also taken care of
those Saints stationed here.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.430
But the damned Saints... They keep rising up.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:40.120
No matter what we do,
they won't let us in the Sanctuary.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.440
There's no need to hurry.

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:45.810
The Sanctuary is within our grasp.

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:47.380
From our previous battles, we know

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:52.390
that these Saints won't be
much to contend with.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.390
Rose petals?

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:02.780
What?

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:06.650
Red roses cover all the paths
leading to the Sanctuary!

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:14.240
Idiot! A few thorns are stopping you?

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:18.040
These won't have any effect with our armor!

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:26.020
Uh... No...

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.210
These are...

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:37.430
I think you should go no farther, Sir Minos.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.900
These are Demon Roses.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:42.320
And very strong ones.

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:45.590
Their mere scent will kill you.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:49.320
Why is an underling of Rhadamanthys here?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:52.040
Earthly Dark Star, Deep Niobe.

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.260
Don't worry about it.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:58.330
More importantly, there is a
mastermind behind this.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.660
Welcome, Specters.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.710
Who are you?

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:11.590
I am Albafica. The Pisces Gold Saint.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:14.010
The Pisces Gold Saint?

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.680
Albafica?

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:20.220
One of the twelve most powerful Gold Saints.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:23.600
So you've come out here,
all the way from the zodiac.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:27.360
But that man... My...

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.520
How beautiful...

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:35.720
To think you brought yourselves
to death's doorstep...

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.470
How foolish.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.530
Just as he said,

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:42.410
these are Demon Roses.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.470
If you are prepared to die,

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:47.540
as these two have, then please enter my garden.

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:51.530
Or do you prefer to leave now,
with your tails between your legs?

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:52.760
Specters!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.180
What? Let's tear him apart!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:57.660
We'll be fine, as long as we
don't touch the thorns!

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:00.510
And he's just standing in the
middle of the rose garden!

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:05.270
<i>Royal Demon Rose!</i>

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:12.950
Damn it...

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:16.390
Wh-Why?

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:21.540
Why are you unaffected, in the
middle of all these poisonous roses?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:28.130
Truly, you're blessed with some
wonderful underlings, Sir Minos.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.970
Don't let his beauty distract you.

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:35.920
Just like the flowers in this garden,

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:38.330
he is a poisonous rose.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:51.000
Red smoke rises from beyond the
rocky hills that surround the Sanctuary.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:55.110
Is that Albafica's Demon Rose scent?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.340
Dohko.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:00.950
Yes, Shion?

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:04.580
How were the defenses in
and around the Sanctuary?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.470
It appears they will be ready in time.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:10.080
A few of the other Gold Saints are
also taking command positions.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:16.020
All this is thanks to Albafica spreading his roses.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:20.950
Not even the Specters should be able to pass

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:23.220
the Demon Rose garden that
protects the Sanctuary.

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:26.600
So he has gone there to
defend this place on his own.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:32.610
I've heard the story of the Pisces Saint before.

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:36.100
As you know, the house of Aries,
which I guard,

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:38.600
is first of the twelve houses of the zodiac,

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:42.570
from Athena's Chamber to the Pope's.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:47.630
And we, the Gold Saints, guard all
twelve houses of the zodiac constellations.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:52.540
And the last house of the zodiac, Pisces,

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:55.400
directly connects to the Pope's Chambers.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:11:00.530
Therefore, the area between the Chambers and the house of Pisces

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:04.640
is filled with Demon Roses to keep out intruders.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:08.410
The Demon Rose's poison is so deadly,

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.350
it kills any who come in contact with it.

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.830
So the guardian of the Pisces house

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.270
must cohabitate with the deadly poisonous rose,

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:19.020
thus building up resistance to the poison.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:22.040
Albafica is the complete specimen.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:26.280
His very blood is said to be toxic.

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:31.450
He is beautiful, and many adore him,

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:34.200
but he rarely approaches people on his own.

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.800
It may be because of his poisonous body.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:40.050
They say every rose has its thorn, but...

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:42.550
No, Dohko.

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.040
The rose keeps itself apart because of its thorn.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.270
So who's next?

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:53.780
Should we toss in some of the leftover underlings?

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:56.150
Or...

00:11:56.650 --> 00:12:01.530
Will you come forward yourself, Griffin Minos?

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:08.160
Now, now, Sir Minos, leave this to me.

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:17.510
The Demon Rose poison won't work on me.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:23.870
It sure smells good in a rose garden.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.260
I don't think a lowlife like you

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:31.140
knows the difference between
a good and a bad rose scent.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.190
Huh?

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:34.300
Come, I'll play with you.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.730
Happily!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:41.150
I'll crush that pretty little face of yours!

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:43.090
What?

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.840
What about my face?

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:50.790
What is that black rose?

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:54.080
The black roses tear through
everything they touch.

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:55.830
Tear it up...

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.380
<i>Piranhan Rose!</i>

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:16.530
It's no use.

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:20.610
No matter where you hide,
you can't elude these black roses.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:26.040
I'll praise your ability to survive
in this rose garden.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.370
But this time, it's over.

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:34.750
Your roses are the ones that will be of no use.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:35.960
Huh?

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.080
<i>My roses?</i>

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.840
<i>Impossible... The roses are dying.</i>

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:53.350
<i>This aroma's thickening around the roses?</i>

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.850
<i>Deep Fragrance!</i>

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:02.360
My own aroma is far denser
than that of the Demon Rose.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:04.350
This sweet scent

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:07.960
penetrates the skin directly,
paralyzing the five senses.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:12.490
And the enemy eventually falls
into a deep, sleep-like death.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:19.780
<i>This is bad... This aroma spreads quickly.</i>

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:24.000
<i>At this rate, it will seep beyond the
roses and enter the Sanctuary.</i>

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:27.510
<i>No. Before that, there's the nearby village.</i>

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.770
<i>I must at least halt the poison's spread!</i>

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:34.790
<i>What?</i>

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.540
<i>The aroma is gathering around him.</i>

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.640
<i>What is he thinking?</i>

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:44.820
Hey... The sky looked like a sunset before,

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.860
with Sir Albafica's rose aroma.

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:50.070
But it's changing into a weird, light purple color.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:52.370
Could it be that Sir Albafica...

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:58.730
The Saints protecting the Earth
cannot have fallen so easily.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:02.250
Everyone here, in Rodorio Village, knows that!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:07.620
But I'm sure the Saints will protect Lady Athena first.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.380
And when they do, they'll forget about us.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.830
Why do we have to be dragged into the Holy War,

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.500
just because our village is close to the Sanctuary?

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:36.530
<i>It'll be okay. Sir Albafica is a kind person.</i>

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:41.580
<i>When he left, he promised
he would surely protect us.</i>

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:51.800
He's dead.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:56.730
I don't know if he lost his mind or what,
taking on all of my poison.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.990
Crap! A rose scent!

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:06.560
Whatever! Destroying my armor!

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:14.280
<i>Wh-What? For a moment,
I felt a weird presence.</i>

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:21.090
Wh-What is this red fog?

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:23.120
When did this happen?

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:27.630
No...

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:39.240
Your poisonous scent really
wasn't anything so great...

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:45.600
No. You were exposed to so
much Deep Fragrance. How?

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.190
Fool.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:51.780
You thought your poison would work on me now?

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:56.780
I've lived alongside these
lethal roses for years.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.950
My very life blood is full of poison!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.870
<i>Crimson Thorn!</i>

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.050
<i>The blood fog has become needles?</i>

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:19.050
The Demon Rose scent didn't work on you

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:24.070
because you had surrounded yourself with your Deep Fragrance,

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:26.330
offsetting the effects.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:31.940
So, I'll inject my toxic blood directly into your body!

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.490
Beautiful!

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:43.450
I see this pleases you, Griffin Minos.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:51.550
Yes, you will truly make a beautiful puppet,

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.460
Pisces Albafica.

00:17:57.210 --> 00:18:00.970
In other words, allow me to entertain you.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.480
<i>Gigantic Feathers Flap!</i>

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:14.980
Oh, that's...

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:19.060
Sir Albafica's roses are rising into the sky!

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:20.870
What's going on?

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:24.390
<i>Sir Albafica...</i>

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:30.160
<i>What power.</i>

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:32.960
<i>To send the remaining Demon Roses
flying by their roots...</i>

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.260
I didn't need to rely on Niobe.
The Demon Rose was nothing to me,

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:46.390
right from the start.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:50.920
How does it feel to lose the roses
you so relied upon?

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:52.650
It's safe to say

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:57.780
you are like a sad, single rose
left in a wild field. Don't you agree?

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:01.150
No, rather a pretty, powerless flower.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:07.160
Do you think I cannot fight
without my rose garden?

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:10.240
<i>Piranhan Rose!</i>

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.090
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:25.640
<i>My body... It moves on its own?</i>

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.980
<i>Cosmic Marionettion!</i>

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:33.270
What?

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:39.570
You can't move even a
fingertip of your own accord.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:47.260
Those controlled by all of these
invisible strings become my puppets.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:50.080
That includes even you,

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.660
a Gold Saint.

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:54.280
Y-Yay!

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:55.840
You did it, Sir Minos!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.450
Now what are you doing?

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:04.050
While I hold him back,
you head for the Sanctuary.

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:04.840
Yeah!

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.430
W-Wait!

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:12.620
Now then... Before, you absorbed all of Niobe's

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:15.350
Deep Fragrance, to prevent
the poison from spreading.

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:20.320
And I heard about a small village
near the Sanctuary.

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:22.830
Interesting!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.730
It will be a nice appetizer
before the Sanctuary attack.

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:29.210
Kill everyone in that village!

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:30.010
Yes!

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:32.250
What?

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.500
W-Wait!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.250
I told you, it's no use.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.550
You...

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:47.050
It's the right of the powerful
to play with the weak.

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:51.560
If you try to resist, you'll break your bones.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:56.460
But it's no fun to just break a doll like you.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:21:00.320
I'll play with you a little
before I head for the Sanctuary.

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:04.990
First, I'll take that pretty face you're so proud of

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.990
and I'll break it for you.

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:22.910
Next, shall we go for your arms? Or your legs?

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:24.470
Or how about

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:27.310
we go straight for your neck and break it?

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:28.720
Choose!

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.600
All right, let's go for those rebellious eyes.

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:46.490
Minos...

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.020
Minos...

00:21:48.650 --> 00:21:52.740
I have no intention of playing with you,
or of being played with by you.

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:56.250
Break my face, my arms, my legs...
to your heart's content!

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.630
But I won't let you set a single foot past me!

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:03.180
Oh, so you would break your own right arm

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:06.630
to resist my Cosmic Marionettion.

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:10.710
Which means you're prepared
to break your own body.

00:22:10.710 --> 00:22:12.140
Interesting!

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:04.630
Lord Hades,

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:07.710
it is only a matter of time before
Minos destroys the Sanctuary.

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:12.980
The Pegasus Saint is dead.
And that little thief, Athena, will soon follow.

00:24:13.660 --> 00:24:17.220
Now no one will stand in our way.

00:24:17.750 --> 00:24:20.260
Just as you wanted it, Lord Hades.

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:24.990
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:24.990 --> 00:24:26.400
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...

00:24:27.300 --> 00:24:28.900
Floral Funeral Procession.
